        "description":"\u201cKratos\u201d is built to forge a strong, muscular upper body through a combination of strength training and hypertrophy work. Each session is made to grow size where it counts. Chest, delts, arms, and back will all be hammered, (legs will still be a part of the program) while developing the raw strength to prove it. It\u2019s not just about looking like a god-slayer, but having the strength of one.\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\nThe ideal way to run \u201cKratos\u201d is to do all three blocks, although, you can choose to run singular blocks instead.\n\nBlock 1 - Block 1 takes a both hypertrophy and strength-based approach. This is the main block of the program that defines mass and strength put together into one block.\n\nBlock 2 - Block 2 focuses on more of a hypertrophy progression, while having it\u2019s main focus put towards mass. The muscular growth from this block should be the most significant.\n\nBlock 3 - Block 3 focuses on more of a strength progression, while still having it\u2019s hypertrophy elements. The strength gains from this block should be the most significant.",
        "level":"['Novice', 'Intermediate', 'Advanced', 'Beginner']",
